{"id":"8ad179c98b9a237c","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-free-for.md","title":"Free For","display":"df-free-for — Free For","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-free-for","aliases":["58-df-free-for"],"display":"df-free-for — Free For","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[58-df-first-order-language.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-free-for"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-free-for</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-free-for — Free For"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"58-df-first-order-language.md\">58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span> (一阶签名)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (项, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (变量)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (公式, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\\)</span> (递归变量集算子, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件按公式复杂度递归定义的签名参数化谓词)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (固定环境签名下的兼容记号)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>四分量语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)\\)</span> 使用同一项、公式与变量支持集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_L\\)</span> 由下式作兼容定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}\">\\(\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"58-df-first-order-language.md\">58-df-first-order-language.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}for}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\nt\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land\n\\begin{cases}\n\\top,&amp;\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\psi),&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\psi)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\chi),\n&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\lor\\chi),\\\\\n(y=x)\\lor(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\psi))\n\\lor\\bigl(y\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\n\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\psi)\\bigr),\n&amp;\\varphi=\\forall y\\,\\psi.\n\\end{cases}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}for}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\nt\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\n\\land\n\\begin{cases}\n\\top,&amp;\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\psi),&amp;\\varphi=\\neg\\psi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\psi)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\chi),\n&amp;\\varphi=(\\psi\\lor\\chi),\\\\\n(y=x)\\lor(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_\\Sigma(\\psi))\n\\lor\\bigl(y\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}_\\Sigma(t)\n\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\psi)\\bigr),\n&amp;\\varphi=\\forall y\\,\\psi.\n\\end{cases}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}for\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}for\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_L(t,x,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_{\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)}(t,x,\\varphi)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguage}_S(L)\\to\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_L(t,x,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FreeFor}_{\\mathrm{FormulaSignatureOf}_S(L)}(t,x,\\varphi)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_\\Sigma(t,x,\\varphi)\\)</span> means that substituting <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> for the free occurrences of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> causes no variable capture; the subscript prevents terms and formulas from different signatures from being mixed.</li>\n<li>The recursion follows the primitive constructor basis <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\">\\(\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\\)</span> used by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>; derived connectives and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\">\\(\\exists\\)</span> are handled through their expansions.</li>\n<li>In the quantified case, substitution stops when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=x\">\\(y=x\\)</span>; otherwise either <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> is absent from the body or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> is absent from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> and the recursive condition holds.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a> — 一阶公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a> — 自由变元</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"60d957ce43061cb6\" href=\"?note=60d957ce43061cb6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md\">../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md</a> — 公式代入</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$ (项, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5